<IndustryPage {...pageData}>
<p>UK insurance brokers and providers operate in a heavily regulated, competitive market where efficiency and compliance are paramount. The brokers winning right now are the ones using technology to quote faster, serve clients better, and stay ahead of regulatory requirements. Yet many UK insurance businesses still rely on a tangle of legacy policy management systems, spreadsheets for renewals, and manual processes for insurer communication that slow the team down and create compliance gaps.</p>
<p>Off-the-shelf insurance software is built for the average broker, not your specific model. Generic policy management packages don't understand your unique commission structures, your specific insurer panel arrangements, or the way your renewal process actually works. Quote comparison tools work for standard products but can't handle the niche schemes and specialist lines that differentiate your business. Client portals, where they exist, are rigid templates that don't match your branding or the specific self-service tasks your clients want. Compliance reporting is often a manual export-and-reformat exercise that eats days before every FCA deadline.</p>
<p>We build custom software for UK insurance businesses that streamlines the entire policy lifecycle. From quote management and policy administration to claims tracking and client portals, we build systems that fit your exact workflows. We understand the UK insurance market - from the broker's desk to the compliance office - and we build software that integrates with your existing insurer APIs, rating engines, and back-office systems. Whether it's a bespoke quoting platform that pulls rates from multiple insurers and applies your pricing rules, or a client portal that lets policyholders self-serve document downloads and claim notifications, bespoke software fits your processes.</p>
<p>Insurance compliance carries serious consequences. FCA rules, client money handling (CASS 5), ICOBS requirements, and GDPR consent management all demand meticulous record-keeping and audit trails. A missed renewal notification or an unrecorded client money transaction isn't just a process gap - it's a regulatory breach. Bespoke software tracks every client interaction, every consent, every client money movement, and every compliance certification - with automated alerts for expiring requirements and audit-ready reports generated on demand, replacing manual systems that crumble under regulatory scrutiny.</p>
<p>A UK commercial insurance broker with 4,000 active policies was spending a full week each month preparing FCA compliance reports from data scattered across three systems. We built a bespoke compliance reporting platform that aggregated data from their policy management system, client money records, and training logs, generating FCA-ready reports automatically. Monthly compliance reporting dropped from five days to four hours, renewal retention improved by 8% thanks to automated client reminders, and the broker identified three unrecorded client money transactions that would have failed an FCA audit.</p>
<p>Insurance is a sector where bespoke software delivers clear ROI. Every quote, every policy, and every claim generates data. The opportunity is building software that turns that data into faster quotes, automated compliance, and real-time visibility across every client, insurer, and line of business.</p>

